From 30d3bdd6b382a6cf0a43c9e1c957179830b382ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Bestas <mkbestas@lineageos.org>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:34:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: Add a posture guidance page for face
 enrollment

Devices can require a specific posture for face enrollment by setting
config_face_enroll_guidance_page to a guidance activity and
config_face_enroll_supported_posture to the allowed posture.

AOSP only ships the plumbing and expects the page to be provided by the
OEM. Add FaceEnrollFoldPage, which asks the user to fold the phone and
finishes once the device reaches the configured posture, like the stock
Pixel OS does.

Test: enroll face on Pixel Fold
Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I611dcaffa1a4db67c30108696f2e536920a6fe3b
